resources.string:
You are about to export an unencrypted XML file containing every field value in the vault:
- Plaintext: its contents are directly readable and are not protected by the master password;
- Unprotected: once written to Downloads or a cloud drive, any app or person with access to that location can read it;
- Delete it yourself: this app will not clean it up. Delete it immediately after use and empty the cloud recycle bin.

You are about to export the decrypted attachment content, which is no longer protected by the master password:
- Plaintext: anyone who obtains the file can read its contents directly;
- Unprotected: the target is the Downloads or cloud location you picked, and the app cannot recall it;
- Delete it yourself: this app will not clean it up. Delete it immediately after use and empty the cloud recycle bin.
